    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies the {@code writeTypeIdForDefaultImpl} property of {@link JsonTypeInfo.Value}: see issue [annotations#342]. The property is a nullable {@link Boolean} where: <ul> <li>{@code null} (unset) means \"write the type id\" by default, and</li> <li>an explicit value of {@code TRUE}/{@code FALSE} controls the behaviour directly.</li> </ul> The {@code with...} mutator is expected to return a new instance only when the value actually changes, and the same instance otherwise."
   },
